#: ../../source/addon/display_in.rst:2 daa0ad65c0f8478dbf20f1d17d69d394
msgid "addon DisplayIn"
msgstr "addon DisplayIn"

#: ../../source/addon/display_in.rst:8 ea8f6790387d41bebb3f013ae5e19618
msgid ""
"``DisplayIn`` captures HDMI input from the Display In Add-on (U220) "
"connected to Unit PoE-P4 and saves a frame as a JPEG file. It initializes"
" the LT6911 HDMI receiver when created and releases the capture resources"
" with :meth:`DisplayIn.deinit`."
msgstr ""
"``DisplayIn`` 用于捕获连接至 Unit PoE-P4 的 Display In Add-on (U220) 的 HDMI "
"输入，并将单帧保存为 JPEG 文件。创建对象时会初始化 LT6911 HDMI 接收器，并通过 :meth:`DisplayIn.deinit`"
" 释放采集资源。"

#: ../../source/addon/display_in.rst:13 7c71749664544555947e4d025fdaf5b1
msgid ""
"The current capture format is ``1280x720``. Connect an HDMI source before"
" calling :meth:`DisplayIn.capture`."
msgstr "当前采集格式为 ``1280x720``。调用 :meth:`DisplayIn.capture` 前请连接 HDMI 信号源。"

