msgid ""
"``DisplayIn`` initializes the LT6911 HDMI receiver. Call :meth:`capture` "
"to save one captured frame, then call :meth:`deinit` when capture is no "
"longer needed."
msgstr ""
"``DisplayIn`` 会初始化 LT6911 HDMI 接收器。调用 :meth:`capture` 保存单帧图像；不再需要采集时，调用 "
":meth:`deinit`。"

